Familiarisation of ICs — 7404, 7432, 7408

Aim

To familiarize ourselves with the pin configuration and operation of IC 7404, 7432 and 7408.

ICs Used

IC	Gate

7404	NOT
7432	OR
7408	AND


Procedure

1. Identify the IC using its number and notch/marking.


2. Place the IC correctly on the breadboard.


3. Identify its VCC and GND pins.


4. Connect VCC to +5V and GND to ground.


5. Identify the input and output pins using the pin diagram.


6. Give suitable input combinations.


7. Observe the output using LED.


8. Compare the output with the corresponding truth table.



Result

The pin configuration and operation of IC 7404, 7432 and 7408 were successfully studied.
